{"id": 5456, "title": "Twenty years later", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "twenty-years-later", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/5456_twenty-years-later.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["最近上海的一位妈妈因为女儿不认真写作业生气到抓狂，但是妈妈的生气却让她的父亲母亲很开心。", "原来23年前，这位妈妈的爸爸辅导她作业时就遇到了同样的事情，女儿不认真写作业因此写了一封信给女儿，信里说：以后有一天你也会成为父母，将来你的孩子发生你现在这样的问题，你会怎么做呢？"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["最近上海的一位媽媽因為女兒不認真寫作業生氣到抓狂，但是媽媽的生氣卻讓她的父親母親很開心。", "原來23年前，這位媽媽的爸爸輔導她作業時就遇到了同樣的事情，女兒不認真寫作業因此寫了一封信給女兒，信裡說：以後有一天你也會成為父母，將來你的孩子發生你現在這樣的問題，你會怎麼做呢？"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["zuì jìn Shàng hǎi de yī wèi mā ma yīn wèi nǚ ér bù rèn zhēn xiě zuò yè shēng qì dào zhuā kuáng， dàn shì mā ma de shēng qì què ràng tā de fù qīn mǔ qīn hěn kāi xīn。", "yuán lái 23 nián qián， zhè wèi mā ma de bà ba fǔ dǎo tā zuò yè shí jiù yù dào le tóng yàng de shì qing， nǚ ér bù rèn zhēn xiě zuò yè yīn cǐ xiě le yī fēng xìn gěi nǚ ér， xìn lǐ shuō： yǐ hòu yǒu yī tiān nǐ yě huì chéng wéi fù mǔ， jiāng lái nǐ de hái zi fā shēng nǐ xiàn zài zhè yàng de wèn tí， nǐ huì zěn me zuò ne？"], "english_paragraphs": ["Recently, a mother in Shanghai was so angry that her daughter didn't do her homework seriously that she went crazy. However, the mother's anger made her parents very happy.", "It turns out that 23 years ago, this mother's father encountered the same thing when he was helping her with her homework. Her daughter didn't do her homework seriously, so he wrote a letter to her. The letter said: One day you will also become a parent. In the future, your child will have the same problem as you do now. What will you do?"], "english_full": "Recently, a mother in Shanghai was so angry that her daughter didn't do her homework seriously that she went crazy. However, the mother's anger made her parents very happy.\n\nIt turns out that 23 years ago, this mother's father encountered the same thing when he was helping her with her homework. Her daughter didn't do her homework seriously, so he wrote a letter to her. The letter said: One day you will al